Skyfury Totem
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemSkyfury 
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Triggering unit) Equal to Nazgrek
            Then - Actions
                -------- Destroy existing totems --------
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in TotemGroupNazgrekFire and do (Unit - Kill (Picked unit))
                -------- Create totem --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Level of TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemSkyfury  for (Triggering unit)) Equal to 1
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- LEVEL 1 --------
                        Set VariableSet TotemVarPoint = (Target point of ability being cast)
                        Unit - Create 1 Skyfury Totem for Player 1 (Red) at TotemVarPoint facing Default building facing degrees
                        Set VariableSet Totem = (Unit-type of (Last created unit))
                        Set VariableSet TotemGenericTimer = 45.00
                        Unit - Add a TotemGenericTimer second Generic expiration timer to (Last created unit)
                        -------- ============ ADD to Unit Group(s) --------
                        Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to TotemGroupNazgrekFire
                        Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to TotemGroupNazgrek
                        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_TotemVarPoint)
                        -------- Turn ON triggers --------
                        Set VariableSet SF_Source = (Last created unit)
                        Trigger - Run Skyfury Aura Add Source <gen> (ignoring conditions)
                        -------- Text --------
                        Floating Text - Create floating text that reads <Skyfury Totem> above (Last created unit) with Z offset TotemTextOffsetZ, using font size TotemTextFontSize, color (100.00%, 15.00%, 15.00%), and 0.00% transparency
                        Set VariableSet TotemText[(Custom value of (Last created unit))] = (Last created floating text)
                        Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to TotemTextGroup
                        Floating Text - Change (Last created floating text): Disable permanence
                        Floating Text - Change the lifespan of (Last created floating text) to TotemGenericTimer seconds
                        Floating Text - Change the fading age of (Last created floating text) to (TotemGenericTimer - 1.00) seconds
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Level of TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemSkyfury  for (Triggering unit)) Equal to 2
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- LEVEL 2 --------
                        Set VariableSet TotemVarPoint = (Target point of ability being cast)
